<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<wodefinitions>
	<wo class="ERXWOTemplate" content="expected" unknownAttributes="forbidden">

		<doc><![CDATA[A named piece of content passed to a wrapper component, for wrappers that take more than one piece of content. Inside the wrapper, an `ERXWOComponentContent` with the same `templateName` renders it.

```html
<wo:MyWrapper>
  <wo:ERXWOTemplate templateName="header">Title</wo:ERXWOTemplate>
  <wo:ERXWOTemplate templateName="body">…</wo:ERXWOTemplate>
</wo:MyWrapper>
```

A plain `WOComponentContent` in the wrapper renders all of the content, the templates included.]]></doc>

		<binding name="templateName" required="true">
			<pull><type>java.lang.String</type></pull>
			<doc>The name an `ERXWOComponentContent` in the wrapper refers to, to render this content.</doc>
		</binding>

	</wo>
</wodefinitions>
